@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

title System Architecture — Vision + Agentic Core

actor "User / Tester" as User

node "Agentic Host" {
  [Agentic Core\nbackend service] as Agentic
}

node "Vision Host" {
  component "Vision Service (FastAPI)" as VisionAPI
  component "YOLO Model (weights)" as YOLOModel
  component "OCR Engines" as OCRs
  database "Local FS / Sessions" as Storage
}

node "Optional GPU Node" as GPU {
  [GPU for YOLO inference] as GPUDevice
}

User -> Agentic : trigger task (e.g., perceive)
Agentic -> VisionAPI : HTTP POST /vision/start or /vision/capture
VisionAPI -> YOLOModel : read model (inference)
VisionAPI -> OCRs : call Tesseract / EasyOCR / PaddleOCR
VisionAPI -> Storage : read/write session files (raw_frames, outputs)
VisionAPI -> Agentic : return final JSON (vision_data)

VisionAPI --> GPUDevice : (optional) accelerate detection

note right of VisionAPI
- Runs on a host (container or VM)
- Exposes ports (e.g., 8001)
- Can be horizontally scaled for load
end note

note left of OCRs
- Tesseract (system binary)
- EasyOCR (python)
- PaddleOCR (python; requires paddlepaddle install)
end note

@enduml